      "severity": "medium",
      "title": "FavoriteServiceImpl.listFavorites 未设置 totalPages，导致 ArkTS 提前终止分页",
      "description": "FavoriteServiceImpl.listFavorites 手动构造 PageResult 时只设置了 records/total/page/pageSize，未设置 totalPages（保持默认值 0）。ArkTS FavoriteService.getFavorites 读取 result.totalPages 后执行 do-while(currentPage <= totalPages)，因此只在首次请求时加载一页，后续页被静默丢弃。",
      "sources": [
        { "file": "uniseek_java/src/main/java/com/uniseek/service/impl/FavoriteServiceImpl.java", "lines": "80-85", "what": "new PageResult 缺少 setTotalPages" },
        { "file": "uniseek_java/src/main/java/com/uniseek/common/PageResult.java", "lines": "39-50", "what": "PageResult.of 工厂方法会计算 totalPages，但本处未使用" },
        { "file": "uniseek_arkts/entry/src/main/ets/services/FavoriteService.ets", "lines": "42-54", "what": "依赖 result.totalPages 判断是否需要翻页" }
      ],
      "impact": "ArkTS 端‘我的收藏’最多返回第一页（默认 20 条），超出部分不可见。",
      "recommendation": "在 FavoriteServiceImpl.listFavorites 中使用 PageResult.of(favPage) 或按 total/pageSize 计算 totalPages 后 setTotalPages。"
    },
